{"version":1,"key":"card:303","content":{"id":303,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"04a8111e-2a72-4189-83d2-c922766bd90c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于不合理的需求沟通，不要直接说不，这样会产生不信任感，但是也是有策略的："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"f07b9a66-095e-426a-81bb-0c1a809108aa","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"188d255f-67d9-48b8-8061-0bca16f76923","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0b15f32-d75e-453b-b6c4-7e412e671785","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于做不到的需求，不要说需求做不到，特别是不要马上说做不到，你要先想一下，让别人觉得你是想做的，但是仔细思考后，发现的确做不到，这个时候你可以给一个你的方案。诀窍是给一个你可以做得到的方案，而不是将对方的方案直接回绝掉。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9e23db15-db85-435a-8082-d0a071a961c9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"263001c7-edc4-410a-b7c1-d5f4fa211d81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于复杂的需求，也不要马上说不，先问清这么做的原因和目的，然后给一个自己的方案，这个需求好复杂，可不可以先做这一部分，然后再做另一部分。诀窍是我不能完全满足你，但可以部分满足你。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6daa23db-233b-401d-83f6-db6385432f47","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"85746bb9-b922-4597-b1fa-2c789a018093","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于时间不够的需求，三种回答："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"6b2389c5-5fdd-4f34-b6e2-67570eb2c54c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"96932764-f84a-4f86-b053-9d0e96ce559f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"201ece81-ca60-4f31-88f4-352412e7cb83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我可以加班加点完成，但是 bug 会比较多，这个你要认，并且后面要给我留时间还技术债"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"30075d52-ed28-49ee-aec0-b6fe22111099","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8d5cdf4-5214-4665-bfc5-02579f4ff4df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我可以加班加点完成，并且保证质量，但是需求太多了，可不可以减少一些"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b512507b-8d50-424b-8a96-28376aa3867c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e54a67c4-ee19-48ad-a52b-bbf187590c9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我可以保证质量完成所有的需求，但是能不能多给两周的时间"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a7fb129-b129-445a-b44a-25207a84af87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里的诀窍是，我不能说不，但我要有条件的说是，看似给了需求方选择，实际上我掌握了主动"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f5c1836-aad6-4af1-bb05-20c9c1457b14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以积极主动的态度对不合理的需求进行讨价还价。"}]}],"tags":["职场/技巧","技巧/职场"],"createTime":1693060333904,"updateTime":1761990031336,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761990031336}}